<li><h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Root Canal or Extraction</h4><p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">A dental-origin gumboil requires treatment of the source tooth — root canal to save it, or extraction if non-restorable. <a href="severe-tooth-infection-treatment-hyderabad.php" class="text-secondary underline">Severe tooth infection</a> treatment details these options.</p></li>
